    "author": ""
  },
  {
    "text": "zuck\n4d\nMuse, your personal agent, now has voice and real-time video. You can have long conversations and Muse will work in the background and get things done for you as you're talking. We're also bringing Muse to glasses so you can talk hands-free throughout the day.\n1.3K\n109\n72\n50",
